Package: stellar-wim
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
Description: lightweight Wayland compositor with tabs, tiling and effects
 Stellar WiM is a fork of Labwc 0.20.3. It keeps Labwc's floating-first,
 stacking behaviour and adds opt-in tab groups, five tiling modes, runtime
 profiles, local IPC control and visual effects. Effects are on by default,
 including fade-out on minimize and tab hide; tabs and tiling are off by
 default and IPC can be disabled in rc.xml. The fork installs under its own
 name so it can coexist with Labwc.
 .
 This package contains the stellar-wim compositor, the stellar-wimctl
 control tool, session metadata and documentation.
